{"id":21525,"author":"Protel","body":"\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eMore staff spotlights, please welcome Sho to the stage! ....Aren't you sho excited?\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eIntroduce yourself--\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(44, 45, 48); display: block; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"height: 0px; color: transparent; display: inline-block; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(44, 45, 48); font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003eHey I'm Sho, love me or hate me but I'm a moderator like I once was. I'm a pretty old player who's been around here for a while since mczone but other than that I've been playing this game on and off for a couple of years now and since I made plenty of friends in mczone that are still here to this day, so I like to hold onto them. Other than that I come onto ts pretty often so you can pm me or something if you need help I guess\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(44, 45, 48); display: block; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"height: 0px; color: transparent; display: inline-block; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(44, 45, 48); display: block; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"height: 0px; color: transparent; display: inline-block; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(44, 45, 48); font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e​\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"copyonly\" style=\"height: 0px; color: transparent; display: inline-block; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"\u003e*\u003c/span\u003eWhat are you most excited/obsessed over at the moment?\u003cspan class=\"copyonly\" style=\"height: 0px; color: transparent; display: inline-block; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"\u003e*\u003c/span\u003e​\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(44, 45, 48); display: block; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"height: 0px; color: transparent; display: inline-block; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(44, 45, 48); font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003eI am currently excited about my summer break as it's been a while since I had a lengthy holiday and I definitely could use one. I've only got a couple of weeks left to go.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"emoji-outer emoji-sizer\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.125rem; font-size: 1.375rem; vertical-align: middle; margin-top: -4px; display: inline-block; height: 1em; width: 1em; color: rgb(44, 45, 48); font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"emoji-inner\" title=\"open_mouth\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; width: 22px; height: 22px; background-size: 4100% !important; text-indent: 100%; color: transparent; text-shadow: none; background-image: url(https://a.slack-edge.com/e4cee/img/emoji_2016_02_06/sheet_apple_64_indexed_256colors.png); background-position: 67.5% 47.5%; background-repeat: initial initial;\"\u003e:open_mouth:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(44, 45, 48); display: block; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"height: 0px; color: transparent; display: inline-block; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(44, 45, 48); display: block; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"height: 0px; color: transparent; display: inline-block; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(44, 45, 48); font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e​\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"copyonly\" style=\"height: 0px; color: transparent; display: inline-block; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"\u003e*\u003c/span\u003eWhat interests you the most in life?\u003cspan class=\"copyonly\" style=\"height: 0px; color: transparent; display: inline-block; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"\u003e*\u003c/span\u003e​\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(44, 45, 48); display: block; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"height: 0px; color: transparent; display: inline-block; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(44, 45, 48); font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003eThe motivation to be successful and live a life that's actually worth living.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(44, 45, 48); display: block; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"height: 0px; color: transparent; display: inline-block; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(44, 45, 48); display: block; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"height: 0px; color: transparent; display: inline-block; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(44, 45, 48); font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e​\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"copyonly\" style=\"height: 0px; color: transparent; display: inline-block; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"\u003e*\u003c/span\u003eWhat music/art/media do you like?\u003cspan class=\"copyonly\" style=\"height: 0px; color: transparent; display: inline-block; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"\u003e*\u003c/span\u003e​\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(44, 45, 48); display: block; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"height: 0px; color: transparent; display: inline-block; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(44, 45, 48); font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003eI'm not too restrcited with music genres since I'll grab any song that I like regardless of genre, but mainly I enjoy EDM and chill vibes in general. As for movies and art, generally speaking I enjoy horror, dystopia and dark comedy, but I'll watch any show that actually has value to it. My favorite tv show is the man in the high castle and my favorite movie would probably be the silence of the lambs. Oh, and I also read creepypastas but that's about it.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(44, 45, 48); display: block; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"height: 0px; color: transparent; display: inline-block; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(44, 45, 48); display: block; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"height: 0px; color: transparent; display: inline-block; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(44, 45, 48); font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e​\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"copyonly\" style=\"height: 0px; color: transparent; display: inline-block; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"\u003e*\u003c/span\u003eWhere are you from?\u003cspan class=\"copyonly\" style=\"height: 0px; color: transparent; display: inline-block; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"\u003e*\u003c/span\u003e​\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(44, 45, 48); display: block; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"height: 0px; color: transparent; display: inline-block; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(44, 45, 48); font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003eThailand\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(44, 45, 48); display: block; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"height: 0px; color: transparent; display: inline-block; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(44, 45, 48); display: block; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"height: 0px; color: transparent; display: inline-block; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(44, 45, 48); font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e​\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"copyonly\" style=\"height: 0px; color: transparent; display: inline-block; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"\u003e*\u003c/span\u003eWhat are the most common questions you get asked while moderating?\u003cspan class=\"copyonly\" style=\"height: 0px; color: transparent; display: inline-block; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"\u003e*\u003c/span\u003e​\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(44, 45, 48); display: block; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"height: 0px; color: transparent; display: inline-block; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(44, 45, 48); font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e\"Are staff apps open?\" \" \u0026nbsp;\"omg why did i get kicked\" \u0026nbsp; \"how do I apply for mod\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(44, 45, 48); background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"copyonly\" style=\"height: 0px; color: transparent; display: inline-block; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"\u003e*\u003c/span\u003e​\u003cbr\u003e~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(44, 45, 48); display: block; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"height: 0px; color: transparent; display: inline-block; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(44, 45, 48); font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://www.avicus.net/Sho\" title=\"Link: http://www.avicus.net/Sho\"\u003ewww.avicus.net/Sho\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/font\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eMore staff spotlights, please welcome Sho to the stage! ....Aren't you sho excited?\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eIntroduce yourself--\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(44, 45, 48); display: block; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"height: 0px; color: transparent; display: inline-block; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(44, 45, 48); font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003eHey I'm Sho, love me or hate me but I'm a moderator like I once was. I'm a pretty old player who's been around here for a while since mczone but other than that I've been playing this game on and off for a couple of years now and since I made plenty of friends in mczone that are still here to this day, so I like to hold onto them. Other than that I come onto ts pretty often so you can pm me or something if you need help I guess\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(44, 45, 48); display: block; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"height: 0px; color: transparent; display: inline-block; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(44, 45, 48); display: block; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"height: 0px; color: transparent; display: inline-block; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(44, 45, 48); font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e​\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"copyonly\" style=\"height: 0px; color: transparent; display: inline-block; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"\u003e*\u003c/span\u003eWhat are you most excited/obsessed over at the moment?\u003cspan class=\"copyonly\" style=\"height: 0px; color: transparent; display: inline-block; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"\u003e*\u003c/span\u003e​\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan class=\"para_break\" style=\"font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; height: 0.5rem; color: rgb(44, 45, 48); display: block; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"copy_only\" style=\"height: 0px; color: transparent; display: inline-block; background-size: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(44, 45, 48); font-family: Slack-Lato, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003eI am currently excited about my summer break as it's been a while since I had a lengthy holiday and I definitely could use one. I've only got a couple of weeks left to go.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"emoji-outer emoji-sizer\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 